<p class="hero-intro">
    Shai Gilgeous-Alexander is 6'4.5" with a 6'11.5" wingspan — nearly 7 inches longer than his height, which is extraordinary for a point guard. His top tracked speed in games is approximately 17 to 18 mph, but raw speed is not what makes him dangerous. Here is the full breakdown of his measurements and what makes his athletic profile so unusual for his position.
  </p>
