<div class="callout-text"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Shai Gilgeous-Alexander is <strong>6 feet 4.5 inches</strong> tall with a <strong>6 foot 11.5 inch wingspan</strong> — a "+7 inch" wingspan-to-height differential that is extreme even by NBA standards. His standing reach is <strong>8'8"</strong> and his combine-tested vertical jump is <strong>36 inches</strong>. These measurements, from the 2018 NBA Draft Combine, explain his defensive length and finishing ability far more than his top speed does.</div>
</div>
<!-- SECTION 1 -->
<h2>The Numbers — SGA's Athletic Profile</h2>
<div class="player-card">
<div class="player-name">Shai Gilgeous-Alexander</div>
<div class="player-sub">Oklahoma City Thunder · Point Guard · 2026 NBA MVP · Born July 12, 1998</div>
